  - m_Id: 4443858371620878
    m_Key: STORAGE SLOT / Rifle, compact rifle and shotgun. Replaces capacitor or
      rapid charge bridge. Energy reduction is rounded up before the hit-marker surcharge;
      existing biological research still applies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620879
    m_Key: "SOURCE: MC00 random Mooncore event \u2192 carry the fragment through
      a successful extraction \u2192 move it to storage. Circuit boards and copper
      coils come from supply caches. Only recovered, non-emergency materials count."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620880
    m_Key: Recover the required alien organs and tissue, then move them to personal
      storage.
