  - m_Id: 4443858371620914
    m_Key: "Mooncore recycler: research and fabricate at Suppliers \u2192 Halo research.
      Other compatible modules can be bought or recovered from caches."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620915
    m_Key: "An anomalous MC00 crystal. Successfully extract it, then store it for
      Mooncore stabilization research and repeatable recycler fabrication at Suppliers
      \u2192 Halo research. Research and fabrication consume separate fragments only
      when confirmed. Can still be sold; carried fragments drop on death."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620917
    m_Key: "; first non-emergency recovery also grants +10. Keep the fragment for
      Suppliers \u2192 Halo research: permanent stabilization research, then repeatable
      recycler fabrication. Confirmed actions consume separate materials. Selling
      remains available."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620918
    m_Key: ; first non-emergency recovery also grants +10. Archive drives remain
      trade goods; no archive research recipe is available.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620919
    m_Key: "Recovered materials are retained. Mooncore fragments can fund stabilization
      research and repeatable recycler fabrication at Suppliers \u2192 Halo research;
      install the crafted module before deploying. Archive drives remain trade goods."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4443858371620920
    m_Key: Recovered Mooncore fragments fund stabilization research and repeatable
      recycler fabrication. Install the module in Halo modification. Knowledge survives
      death; equipment can be lost. Reading records consumes nothing. Fragments and
      archive drives can still be sold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4445446490304512
    m_Key: Energy per round reduced by one third (rounded up); charge time +20%.
      Capacity and base damage unchanged. Cold-silver return arcs pulse during charging
      and firing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4445446532247552
    m_Key: "BEFORE \u2192 AFTER / ENERGY PER ROUND 100% \u2192 2/3 (rounded up) /
      CHARGE TIME 100% \u2192 120%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4445446532247553
    m_Key: 'Fabricated after Mooncore stabilization research. Install in a rifle
      or shotgun storage slot: energy per round reduced by one third (rounded up),
      charge time +20%. Knowledge is permanent; this physical module can be lost
      on death.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
