    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5104936005132288
    m_Key: Inject for 3 seconds to fill surviving body parts to their current recoverable
      health limit. Does not revive destroyed parts or restore health lost to Bounty
      Clash downs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5104936005132289
    m_Key: Inject for 3 seconds to clear poison and gain 600 seconds of immunity
      to tactical poison clouds. Does not prevent other damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5104936005132290
    m_Key: 'Select, then left click to throw after a 1-second action. Explodes after
      a 4-second fuse: up to 650 damage within 8 metres. Cover blocks the blast.
      Clears concertina wire; can kill teammates and the thrower.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5104936005132291
    m_Key: Select, then left click to throw after a 1-second action. A 4-second fuse
      triggers up to 320 damage within 8 metres and 8 seconds of bleeding. Cover
      blocks the blast. Does not clear concertina wire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5104936005132292
    m_Key: Throw to create a 3-metre fire zone for 30 seconds. Deals 8 damage per
      second while exposed. Fire affects enemies, teammates and the thrower.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5104936005132293
    m_Key: Throw to create a 4-metre choke cloud for 20 seconds. Extinguishes fire,
      clears tactical poison and causes coughing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5104936005132294
    m_Key: Place on nearby clear ground with a 3-second action. The trip line alerts
      when any player crosses, including teammates and the owner. Aim at it and hold
      the interaction to disarm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5104936005132295
    m_Key: Place on nearby clear ground with a 3-second action. Any player crossing
      the line releases concertina wire, causing damage, bleeding and slowed movement.
      Dynamite can clear wire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5104936005132296
    m_Key: Place on nearby clear ground with a 3-second action. Any player crossing
      the line releases poison. Choke clouds clear tactical poison; antidote protects
      against it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5104936005132297
    m_Key: Place with a 3-second action. Stores 400 energy; each 2-second resupply
      transfers up to 100, subject to inventory space. Expires after 120 seconds.
      Does not grant a free weapon reload.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
